      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<div style=\"position:relative;\">\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:38px 40px;margin-top:30px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#03402F;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Selitys</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;\">Vaihda muoto: kolmio → kuusikulmio</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;margin:12px 0 32px;\">Muoto muuttuu: kolmio → kuusikulmio. Täyttö pysyy ennallaan.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:132px;height:132px;background:#FFFFFF;border:3px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.30);border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:112px;height:112px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\"><path d=\"M 50.00 27.60 L 72.40 72.40 L 27.60 72.40 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"width:230px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;line-height:1.3;\">Vaihda muoto: kolmio → kuusikulmio</div><div style=\"width:132px;height:132px;background:#FFFFFF;border:3px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.30);border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:112px;height:112px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\"><path d=\"M 61.20 30.60 L 72.40 50.00 L 61.20 69.40 L 38.80 69.40 L 27.60 50.00 L 38.80 30.60 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div></div></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:29px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;margin:20px 0;\">Näin ollen:</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:132px;height:132px;background:#FFFFFF;border:3px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.30);border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:112px;height:112px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\"><path d=\"M 50.00 27.60 L 72.40 72.40 L 27.60 72.40 Z\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"width:230px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;line-height:1.3;\">Vaihda muoto: kolmio → kuusikulmio</div><div style=\"width:132px;height:132px;background:#E4F5E8;border:8px solid #1F9D47;border-radius:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"width:112px;height:112px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;\"><path d=\"M 61.20 30.60 L 72.40 50.00 L 61.20 69.40 L 38.80 69.40 L 27.60 50.00 L 38.80 30.60 Z\" fill=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div></div></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:700;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;margin-top:30px;\">Oikea vastaus on B.</div>\n    </div></div>",
